  "description": "DTDucas Geometry Library for Revit API - A comprehensive set of classes for handling 3D geometry in Revit applications.\n\n\t\t\tKey Features:\n\t\t\t- Point, Line, Curve - Basic geometric primitives with full coordinate system support\n\t\t\t- Surface, Mesh, Solid - Advanced geometry classes for complex 3D modeling\n\t\t\t- Revit API Integration - Seamless conversion between custom types and Revit geometry\n\t\t\t- Geometric Operations - Distance calculation, intersection detection, containment testing\n\t\t\t- Efficient Memory Management - Optimized for performance in Revit applications\n\t\t\t- Full XML Documentation - IntelliSense support for all public members\n\n\t\t\tSupports Revit 2021-2024.",
